            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55658154?u=72eb5d6b966bd3197516e3205b1e2f4962df3cc6&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Test Locally with firefox 140.0.2, firefox does not show any warning message.</p>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span aria-label=\"Video description _2025_07_05_16_33_44_18.mp4\" class=\"m-1\">_2025_07_05_16_33_44_18.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/55658154/462745118-2c284b21-d218-4999-b225-99ac272267cd.mp4?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..HCM2-WygvqN23klTlXOokCEhwWKNilwIZipucOXGdSc\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/55658154/462745118-2c284b21-d218-4999-b225-99ac272267cd.mp4?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..HCM2-WygvqN23klTlXOokCEhwWKNilwIZipucOXGdSc\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"Firefox will warn the user with a prompt &quot;You are about to log in to the site www.example.com with the username username, but the website does not require authentication. This may be an attempt to trick you.&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Firefox will warn the user with a prompt \"You are about to log in to the site www.example.com with the username username, but the website does not require authentication. This may be an attempt to trick you.\"\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This seems outdated, but I can't find the exact version firefox changed this behavior.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
