        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The MDN <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLVideoElement/requestVideoFrameCallback\" rel=\"nofollow\">requestVideoFrameCallback() documentation</a> links to <a href=\"https://requestvideoframecallback.glitch.me/\" rel=\"nofollow\">this demo hosted on Glitch</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Because Glitch is going away, we are re-hosting the demo on the <code class=\"notranslate\">dom-examples</code> repo: see</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3202192382\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/dom-examples/issues/321\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/dom-examples/pull/321/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/dom-examples/pull/321\">mdn/dom-examples#321</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR updates the demo link to point to the new location and makes sure the code is consistent with the demo.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40206",
            "title": "Replace requestVideoFrameCallback() glitch demo link",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-05T08:49:17.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-04T10:56:24.000Z",
