        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This updates the release note added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3166490249\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40034\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40034/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40034\">#40034</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The folder picker functionality is added/supported, but it still isn't all that useful because the returned files are always shown as empty strings.<br>\nThere is additional context to this in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3186810499\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27178\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27178/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27178\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27178</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3166057685\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40024\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40024/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40024\">#40024</a></p>",
