        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26078826?u=9388a2c2a0f1ca2799a4fd23f3e060c353d6ac37&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40178.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3197994020\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40178\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40178/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40178\">#40178</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It's quite a big line diff, but the vast majority of the changes with <code class=\"notranslate\">git diff --word-diff-regex=\".\"</code> are just <code class=\"notranslate\">... varName[-1-] ...</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It's confusing as you're looking around for a contrastive <code class=\"notranslate\">var2</code> variable or something else that would indicate the importance of the number <code class=\"notranslate\">1</code>, but there often isn't anything.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40178.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3197994020\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40178\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40178/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40178\">#40178</a></p>",
