        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/576623?u=88392c52422628facfd7cf108241d2864680915d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CSS value functions lists the available functions supported by different browser. Tree counting functions never added to the list because they were never supported, until now.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 138 added support for <code class=\"notranslate\">sibling-index()</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">sibling-count()</code> functions.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ref:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/138#css_sibling-index_and_sibling-count\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/138#css_sibling-index_and_sibling-count</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/blog/chrome-138-beta#css_sibling-index_and_sibling-count\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/chrome-138-beta#css_sibling-index_and_sibling-count</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Spec: <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#tree-counting\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#tree-counting</a><br>\nBCD: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3130439962\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27019\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27019/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27019\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27019</a></p>",
